  "question": {
    "text": "A bullet is fired vertically upwards with velocity <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#965;</mi></math> from the surface of a spherical planet. When it reaches its maximum height, its acceleration due to the planet&#39;s gravity is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> of its value at the surface of the planet. If the escape velocity from the planet is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#965;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#965;</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt></math> , then the value of N is (ignore energy loss due to atmosphere)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image4-a3c8e0a3-2aed-4e60-9f36-9d9ef83e0f7b.jpg\"/><br ><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br ><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> ...(i)<br >So velocity of particle becomes zero at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br >Given <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt></math><br >So <math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt></math> ...(ii)<br >Applying conservation of energy<br ><math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br >On solving<br ><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br >So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> putting in equation (ii)<br ><math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt></math><br >Comparing <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
